stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING
    PENDING --> RUNNING
    RUNNING --> PASS
    RUNNING --> RETRYABLE_FAILED
    RETRYABLE_FAILED --> RUNNING: within retry budget
    RUNNING --> HOLD: missing input or policy failure
    PASS --> [*]
    HOLD --> COMPENSATED: candidate effect requires cleanup
    HOLD --> [*]: no effect / human handoff
    COMPENSATED --> [*]
